WEBVTT

00:10:00.512 --> 00:10:03.098
(Applause)

00:10:03.098 --> 00:10:04.350
And wait.

00:10:05.059 --> 00:10:07.561
And the other half

00:10:07.603 --> 00:10:10.147
to join the Latinos in Tech Giving Circle,

00:10:10.147 --> 00:10:12.691
because he is a philanthropist.

00:10:13.359 --> 00:10:16.070
Martin is -- thank you.

00:10:16.111 --> 00:10:20.741
Martin is actively using
his voice and his power

00:10:20.783 --> 00:10:24.578
to bring more STEM programs
for kids that look like him.

00:10:24.995 --> 00:10:27.122
That is abundance.

00:10:28.332 --> 00:10:30.751
Life changing things happen